    "detailed_description": "The indie shooting game is born!<br />\r\nThis game is about exploring the steampunk stage by controlling a player which appearance is a bee or butterfly.<br />\r\nENJOI!!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7User Guide<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArrow keys ... operate the player, move<br />\r\nZ key ... Shot, decision<br />\r\nX key ... Special shot<br />\r\nShift key ... The player turns into a bee<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBasically the same as the touhOu project<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb Player characteristics<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBUTTERFLY can move fast and can shoot a wide range of shots<br />\r\nGreat for sparsely populated enemies or when the bullet density is uneven<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBEE is sluggish and can shoot shots focused on a small area<br />\r\nIdeal when enemies are crowded or when you want to move finely and precisely",
